ge, survive. In Soninauts VR, the universe sounds, the AI taunts, your ears rule."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1312402330632319", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Soninautas", "keywords": ["espacio", "galaxias", "astronomia"], "long_description": "Emb\u00e1rcate en una aventura c\u00f3smica VR donde el o\u00eddo manda. Esquiva agujeros negros, atraviesa portales y sobrevive a supernovas con la ayuda \u2014o las burlas\u2014 de una IA sarc\u00e1stica. En Soninautas, el universo suena, re\u00edrse del desastre es casi obligatorio, y solo quien escucha\u2026 vuelve a casa.", "short_description": "Escucha, esquiva, sobrevive. En Soninautas VR, el universo suena, la IA se burla y tu o\u00eddo manda."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://soninautas.iaa.csic.es/en-privacidad-soninautas/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.iaa.csic.es/aviso-legal/", "publisher_name": "Fidesol", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://soninautas.iaa.csic.es/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "es"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25034146402904743"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1157287032435344"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1157287032435344"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1762